+New Features
+------------
+
+- Implemented consumption of manifest files for cp.
+- Add ETag to ls -l and make ls -b variants more efficient.
+- Expand the manifest path to allow for tildes in paths.
+- Added bucket_relocate.sh script to gsutil.
