+    % gsutil -h Content-MD5:VgyllJgiiaRAbyUUIqDMmw== cp obj gs://your-bucket/obj
+    Copying file://obj [Content-Type=text/plain]...
+    Uploading   gs://your-bucket/obj:                                182 b/182 B
